  "adaptations": [
    "Invalid Java tab indices throw IndexOutOfBoundsException; the Rust production API returns Err without invoking any selection listener.",
    "Pinned toolbar hover/selected colors use Zed theme tokens; a fixed 36px BuildPanel header preserves the existing consumer layout. Complete Android Studio theme/palette parity is not established.",
    "GPUI provides native wheel pixel/line conversion; explicit arrow buttons retain the pinned 30px scroll step.",
    "BuildPanel tabs have no close listeners, while its separate hide action retains PanelEvent::Close. Status icons are a consumer extension; creating tabs does not invoke their selection listeners.",
    "Selection and middle-close listeners run through Window::defer after the toolbar entity borrow ends, allowing consumers to clear/rebuild tabs. Programmatic selection assertions flush the GPUI event queue before inspecting the same callback values."
  ],
